{"title":"나는 마도왕이다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=whZxB/hAd4qXq7rd/nD29fU3fqxfILs1PD8XlAk&filename=th3","synopsis":"10년 전, 차원이 비틀리며 몬스터가 쏟아져 나왔다.\n동시에 생겨난 초능력 각성자들이 몬스터를 잡으며 대세가 되는데...\n\n성훈은 한 달에 네 번, 어머니의 병원비를 마련하기 위해\n각성자의 사냥을 돕고, 뒤처리하는 위험천만한 '짐꾼'으로 활동한다.\n\n그러던 중 몬스터에게 큰 부상을 입고 전생을 기억하게 되는데...\n\n\"어라, 나 죽었나?\"\n\n\"나 전생에 대마도사 크라투라스였잖아!!!\"\n\n전생의 기억을 가진 성훈의 갑질 마법이 시작된다!!\n\n\n*********************\n\n판타지 화제작 데카스펠 작가님의 <나는 마도왕이다> 본격 웹툰화!\n세계를 휩쓰는 마도왕의 마법을 웹툰으로 만나 보세요!\n\n*********************","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":171,"change":{"type":"up","amount":103}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":194,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":191,"change":{"type":"up","amount":91}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":182,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":146,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":177,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":217,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":226,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":209,"change":{"type":"up","amount":84}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":178,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":188,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"20